WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.187
The world is watching.

00:00:02.137 --> 00:00:07.087
The United Nations has called on Canada to repeal Track 2 entirely.

00:00:07.087 --> 00:00:10.362
Two Charter challenges are before the courts.

00:00:10.362 --> 00:00:16.637
Veterans testified that 20 of them have documented proof of being offered MAID when seeking healthcare.

00:00:16.637 --> 00:00:21.225
And the federal government says it has no plans to act on any of it.
